NPA RoboCasa ACT runtime derivative

Upstream: RoboCasa commit 8f3c96ec8d1bfcd8126cad2bca887da98d30e997
Upstream license: Apache-2.0
Local version: 1.0.0+npa1

The local patch changes setup.py packaging metadata only. It identifies the
derivative and updates RoboCasa's LeRobot dependency from 0.3.3 to the separately
reviewed 0.6.1+npa1 NPA ACT derivative. It changes no RoboCasa implementation,
assets, task semantics, or simulator behavior. The pinned tianshou dependency and
all other upstream runtime requirements remain declared and resolver-checked.

Only the repository's matched RoboCasa ACT rollout path is qualified. This does not
claim upstream support for LeRobot 0.6.1 or qualify other RoboCasa policy, training,
or deployment paths.
